<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 5,400 MT were mainly the result of increases for Mexico (6,000 MT) and South Korea (6,000 MT) being partially offset by reductions of 7,300 MT for unknown destinations.</p>
<p>Exports of 9,700 MT were to South Korea (6,000 MT), Mexico (3,000 MT), and Colombia (600 MT).</p>
